  "description": "3-phase supply network analyzer, Modbus RTU RS-485. FC03/04 read. Phase V/I/P/Q/PF per phase + 3-phase totals (s32, V×10/mA/W/var/PF×100) at addr 0-50. Line-to-line voltages at 52-58. Energy (+/-) kWh/kvarh at 62-74. THD+flicker at 106-128. Harmonics 1-15 I+V at 800-978. Relays via FC01/FC05 on -C2/-C420 variants.",
  "revision": 1,
  "source": "Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/circutor-cvm-bdm.toml; Source: circutor-cvm-bdm-instruction-manual.pdf (section 12.3, pp. 47-51). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation",
