    "|",
    "| Source: circutor-cvm-bdm-instruction-manual.pdf (section 12.3, pp. 47-51)",
    "| Protocol: Modbus RTU, FC03/04 read, FC01 relay read, FC05 relay write, 8N1 default",
    "| Baud: 1200/2400/4800/9600/19200 bps (configurable; default 9600/8N1)",
    "| All MODBUS addresses are hexadecimal in source; converted to decimal here.",
    "| All parameters are 32-bit \"longs\" (2 consecutive registers).",
    "| Scaling: V×10, current in mA, Hz×10, PF×100, %×10 (THD/flicker/harmonics).",
    "| Relay coil addresses (FC01 read, FC05 write): relay 1 = 0x0000, relay 2 = 0x0001.",
    "| Models: CVM-BDM (base), CVM-BDM-C2 (+2 relays), CVM-BDM-C420 (+relay+AO), CVM-BDM-420 (+2 AO)."
